{"5038530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ichorian Tales", "steam_appid": 5038530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/c1625e94e2ebff4a94449713567aa9ce.poster.avif?t=1788288398\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/c1625e94e2ebff4a94449713567aa9ce.webm?t=1788288398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/c1625e94e2ebff4a94449713567aa9ce.mp4?t=1788288398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 4 intricate DUNGEONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of any good Zelda-like! The dungeons in Ichorian Tales are inspired by challenging &quot;puzzle-box&quot; dungeons like Eagle's Tower, Stone Tower Temple or even the infamous Water Temple.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/d7f83d79f3333d00fe85db7dd9d5f8e5.poster.avif?t=1788288398\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/d7f83d79f3333d00fe85db7dd9d5f8e5.webm?t=1788288398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/d7f83d79f3333d00fe85db7dd9d5f8e5.mp4?t=1788288398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather powerful and unique ITEMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every good dungeon needs a cool new item! Use items to solve puzzles and kill the giant bosses at the end of each dungeon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/bc0095e519a2787ca839db83a91cd0b7.poster.avif?t=1788288398\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/bc0095e519a2787ca839db83a91cd0b7.webm?t=1788288398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/bc0095e519a2787ca839db83a91cd0b7.mp4?t=1788288398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a WORLD full of secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of dungeons, a large explorable world with 6 unique biomes awaits! Every corner could hide secrets to help you on your quest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a TALE of increasingly higher stakes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day while exploring ancient ruins, your protective older brother is trapped inside a magic crystal. What begins as a journey to save your brother ends up uncovering a nefarious plot from an invading force that seeks to steal and control the land you were raised in.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/c1625e94e2ebff4a94449713567aa9ce.poster.avif?t=1788288398\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5038530/extras/c1625e94e2ebff4a94449713567aa9ce.webm?t=178828